{"type": "tool_result", "timestamp": 1793176343.3175611, "id": "f1f8c2b76d4e", "tool_call_id": "call_00_X2x2Hrri0ozexkefq3cF3833", "content": "OK: command succeeded\nstdout:\n1580:    def clear(self):\n1581-        # docstring inherited.\n1582-        super().clear()\n1583-        if self._focal_length == np.inf:\n1584-            self._zmargin = mpl.rcParams['axes.zmargin']\n1585-        else:\n1586-            self._zmargin = 0.\n1587-\n1588-        xymargin = 0.05 * 10/11  # match mpl3.8 appearance\n1589-        self.xy_dataLim = Bbox([[xymargin, xymargin],\n1590-                                [1 - xymargin, 1 - xymargin]])\n1591-        # z-limits are encoded in the x-component of the Bbox, y is un-used\n1592-        self.zz_dataLim = Bbox.unit()\n", "is_error": false, "diff": ""}
