{"type": "assistant_message", "timestamp": 1793176540.6750295, "id": "fce9dfed98cc", "content": "## 不会，除非你把“不 clear”和“每帧新建 artist”同时做\n\n需要分清两件事：\n\n| 现象 | 成因 |\n|---|---|\n| **帧重叠** | 每帧调用一次 `ax.plot()` / `ax_img.fill()` / `ax_img.annotate()`；每个调用都会往 axes 中**新增**一个 artist，旧的不删，于是画面越积越乱。 |\n| **整张重绘** | `blit=False`，每帧都会重画整块画布。它不叠加，只是把同一批 artist 按新坐标重画一遍。 |\n\n当前脚本靠 `clear()` 清空上一帧来避免“帧重叠”。方案 B 的做法正好相反：**不 clear，同时也不新建 artist**——所有 artist 在 `main` 里创建一次，之后每帧只调用它们的 setter 改数值。这样 artist 数量恒定，并不会越积越多。\n\n方案 B 之所以不是“只是删掉 clear()”：如果只删 `clear()` 而保留现有 `ax.plot()` 调用，100 帧后 `ax.lines` 里会有 1100 个 `Line3D`，画面会累积成残影，同时每个新 Line 都会触发 `_request_autoscale_view()`，比例尺又会跳动。\n\n## 每个调用对应的“建一次 / 改数值”\n\n| 现在每帧调用（第 87–124 行） | 方案 B：建一次 | 每帧更新 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `ax.plot(*np.vstack([o, o+L*R[:,i]]).T, ...)` | `ax.plot([], [], [], color=c, lw=2)[0]` | `set_data_3d(xs, ys, zs)` |\n| `ax.text(*origin, \"W\")` | `ax.text(0, 0, 0, \"W\")` → `Text3D` | `set_position_3d((x, y, z))` |\n| `ax.plot(plate_loop, color=\"#666666\")` | 4 条空 `Line3D` | `set_data_3d` |\n| `ax_img.fill(loop_u, loop_v, ...)` | 4 个 `Polygon` + `ax_img.add_patch` | `set_xy(np.c_[uu, vv])` + `set_visible(front[m])` |\n| `ax_img.plot(loop_u, loop_v, \"-\"/\":\")` | 4 条空 `Line2D` | `set_data(uu, vv)` + `set_linestyle(\"-\"/\":\")` |\n| `ax_img.annotate(...)` | 4 个 `ax_img.text(0, 0, f\"A{m}\")` | `set_position((uc, vc))` |\n| `ax.set_xlim/ylim/zlim`、`set_aspect`、`set_title` | 一次（`apply_cube` / `fixed`） | 不再调用 |\n\n对应的 build 骨架（形状和你现在的脚本一致，`n_armors=4` 固定，因此 artist 数量固定）：\n\n```python\ndef build(args, ax, ax2, ax_img, fixed):\n    a = {}\n    apply_cube(ax, fixed[\"ax\"]);  apply_cube(ax2, fixed[\"ax2\"])\n    ax_img.set_xlim(fixed[\"img\"][0], fixed[\"img\"][1])\n    ax_img.set_ylim(fixed[\"img\"][2], fixed[\"img\"][3])\n    ax_img.set_aspect(\"equal\")\n\n    # 3D：W / C / B 每个 3 条轴 + 1 个标签\n    a[\"frames\"]  = [[ax.plot([], [], [], color=c, lw=2)[0] for c in AXIS_COLORS]\n                    for _ in range(3)]\n    a[\"flabels\"] = [ax.text(0, 0, 0, s, fontsize=8) for s in (\"W\", \"C\", \"B\")]\n    a[\"plates\"]  = [ax.plot([], [], [], color=\"#666666\", lw=1.0)[0] for _ in range(4)]\n\n    # close-up：B + 4 套装甲轴\n    a[\"frames2\"]  = [[ax2.plot([], [], [], color=c, lw=2)[0] for c in AXIS_COLORS]\n                     for _ in range(5)]\n    a[\"flabels2\"] = [ax2.text(0, 0, 0, s, fontsize=8)\n                     for s in (\"B\", \"A0\", \"A1\", \"A2\", \"A3\")]\n    a[\"plates2\"]  = [ax2.plot([], [], [], color=ARMOR_COLORS[m], lw=1.2)[0]\n                     for m in range(4)]\n\n    # 2D：填充 + 轮廓 + 标签\n    a[\"fills\"] = []\n    for m in range(4):\n        p = Polygon(np.zeros((4, 2)), closed=True, facecolor=ARMOR_COLORS[m],\n                    alpha=0.35, lw=0, zorder=1)\n        ax_img.add_patch(p)\n        a[\"fills\"].append(p)\n    a[\"edges\"] = [ax_img.plot([], [], color=ARMOR_COLORS[m], lw=1.2, zorder=2)[0]\n                  for m in range(4)]\n    a[\"tags\"]  = [ax_img.text(0, 0, f\"A{m}\", fontsize=8, zorder=3) for m in range(4)]\n    return a\n```\n\n`update` 里就只剩“读取第 i 帧 → setter”，没有任何 `plot` / `fill` / `annotate` / `clear`。\n\n## 三个容易忽略的注意点\n\n1. **`ax_img.fill()` 和 `ax_img.annotate()` 是“每次调用都会新增 artist”的 API**，最容易造成帧重叠；方案 B 里必须换成 `Polygon` + `text` 的复用写法。`annotate` 返回的是 `Annotation`，虽然也能 `set_position`，但直接使用 `text` 更简单。\n2. **保持引用**：这些 artist 必须被某个长期对象（`a` 字典 → `build()` 的返回值 → 被 `on_frame` 闭包捕获）引用着；否则 GC 回收后画面上什么都不显示。\n3. **`n_armors` 一旦可变**（比如以后切换 3 板/4 板），就按上限预建、多余用 `set_visible(False)` 隐藏，而不是按帧增减——这是“不 clear”写法唯一的结构性约束。\n\n## 怎么确认没在叠加\n\n在 `on_frame` 里每隔 20 帧打印一次：\n\n```python\nprint(len(ax.lines), len(ax2.lines), len(ax_img.lines), len(ax_img.patches))\n```\n\n方案 B 下这四个数字**必须每帧完全不变**（示例配置里约 `11 / 16 / 4 / 4`）。如果数字在涨，说明还有代码路径在新建 artist，或者某处又调用了 `plot()`。\n\n顺带：3D 那边 `Line3D.set_data_3d()` 只修改 `_verts3d` 并标记 `stale`，**不会**触发 autoscale（`art3d.py:319`），所以“不 clear + 只改数据”之后，`set_xlim/ylim/zlim` 一次就够，比例尺自然不再跳动。\n\n---\n\n我在 chat（只读）模式，只能给到骨架。要不要我直接把 `scripts/visualize_target.py` 重构成 `build()` + `refresh()`（不 clear、不新建 artist、limits 一次定死、保留你现在的实际时间跳帧），切到 work mode 我就动手改，并用上面那四个计数 + `get_xlim()` 前后对比来验证。", "tool_calls": [], "reasoning": "Confirmed: `Polygon.set_xy`, `Text3D.set_position_3d(xyz)` (line 167) and `set_3d_properties(z)` (195).\n\nNow answer: No accumulation — as long as you don't re-create artists. Explain the distinction: 叠图 = artist 累积（每次 `ax.plot`/`fill` 都新增一个对象）；重绘 = blit=False 整张画布重画（不累积）。方案 B 的前提就是\"建一次 + 改变量\"，所以不会叠。\n\nAlso warn: 如果只删掉 `clear()` 而保留每帧 `ax.plot`，那才会叠，而且是灾难性叠加（100 帧 × 11 条线 = 1100 个 Line3D，越画越慢，也会破坏\"不跳\"——因为每个新 Line 触发 autoscale）。\n\nGive the mapping table and a concrete skeleton for this script, including the `front` toggle via `set_visible`, and linestyle switch for back faces, and the `n_armors` fixed assumption.\n\nAlso mention: `ax_img.fill()` returns a list of Polygons; creating per frame = accumulation. In plan B, create `Polygon(..., closed=True)` + `ax_img.add_patch(p)` once.\n\nAlso mention memory/perf: artists count constant (3 world axes + 3 camera + 3 body + 4 plate outlines + 4*3 armor axes + 4 Polygon + 4 Line2D + 4 Text + 4 labels...). Concretely ~40 artists, fixed.\n\nAlso caution about ordering/zorder: fill polygons need lower zorder than outlines; set `zorder` at creation.\n\nAnd another gotcha: `ax_img.fill` currently also returns patches appended to `ax_img.patches`; with `add_patch` you control it.\n\nAlso: in 3D, line's `set_data_3d` requires all three arrays with equal length; closed loop uses 5 points.\n\nAlso: text labels `A{m}` in 3D look like `Text3D` — update with `set_position_3d((x,y,z))`.\n\nAnother subtle one: `ax.clear()` no longer called → `ax.grid(...)`, `set_title`, `label_axes` will persist; fine.\n\nOne more: 3D auto-z-sorting? Not relevant for lines.\n\nAlso mention: if you *do* want trails (that would be the only legitimate \"叠到一起\"), that's a different feature.\n\nAlso give the \"how to tell it's not accumulating\" check: `len(ax.lines)`, `len(ax_img.patches)`, `len(ax_img.lines)` should stay constant across frames — print them every 20 frames.\n\nLet me write the answer, concise, with code skeleton for the specific script (using current names/lines). Provide the build function code.\n\nI should probably show the actual refactor skeleton:\n\n```python\ndef build(out, args, fig, ax, ax2, ax_img, fixed):\n    w, h = args.image_size\n    cam_pos = np.array([0.0, 0.0, args.height])\n    body = np.array([args.distance, 0.0, args.height])\n    ...\n    art = {\"ax_lines\": [], ...}\n    # 3 条世界轴\n    for c in AXIS_COLORS:\n        art[\"W\"].append(ax.plot([], [], [], color=c, lw=2)[0])\n    ...\n    return art\n```\n\nThat's a lot of code; keep it compact but complete enough. Maybe I show a compact version with helper `mkline3d`. Let's write a skeleton:\n\n```python\ndef build(args, ax, ax2, ax_img, fixed):\n    a = {}\n    apply_cube(ax, fixed[\"ax\"]); apply_cube(ax2, fixed[\"ax2\"])\n    ax_img.set_xlim(fixed[\"img\"][:2]); ax_img.set_ylim(fixed[\"img\"][2:])\n    ax_img.set_aspect(\"equal\")\n\n    # 12 条 3D 轴线：W、C、B\n    a[\"frames3d\"] = [[ax.plot([], [], [], color=c, lw=2)[0] for c in AXIS_COLORS]\n                     for _ in range(3)]\n    a[\"labels3d\"] = [ax.text(0, 0, 0, s, fontsize=8) for s in (\"W\", \"C\", \"B\")]\n    a[\"plates3d\"] = [ax.plot([], [], [], color=\"#666666\", lw=1.0)[0] for _ in range(4)]\n\n    a[\"frames3d2\"] = [[ax2.plot([], [], [], color=c, lw=2)[0] for c in AXIS_COLORS]\n                      for _ in range(5)]        # B + A0..A3\n    a[\"labels3d2\"] = [ax2.text(0, 0, 0, s, fontsize=8) for s in (\"B\", \"A0\", \"A1\", \"A2\", \"A3\")]\n    a[\"plates3d2\"] = [ax2.plot([], [], [], color=ARMOR_COLORS[m], lw=1.2)[0] for m in range(4)]\n\n    a[\"fills\"] = []\n    for m in range(4):\n        p = mpl.patches.Polygon(np.zeros((4, 2)), closed=True,\n                                facecolor=ARMOR_COLORS[m], alpha=0.35, lw=0, zorder=1)\n        ax_img.add_patch(p)\n        a[\"fills\"].append(p)\n    a[\"edges\"] = [ax_img.plot([], [], color=ARMOR_COLORS[m], lw=1.2, zorder=2)[0] for m in range(4)]\n    a[\"tags\"] = [ax_img.text(0, 0, f\"A{m}\", fontsize=8, zorder=3) for m in range(4)]\n    return a\n```\n\nthen `refresh(i, ...)` sets data. This is decent. But is `ax.plot([],[],[])` valid for 3D? yes, Line3D with empty lists.\n\nFor 3D text: `ax.text(x,y,z,s)` returns Text3D; update via `set_position_3d((x,y,z))` — note it takes a 3-tuple. Better: `t.set_position_3d(xyz)`.\n\nFor frames: each axis line gets `set_data_3d(*np.vstack([o, o+L*R[:,i]]).T)` — careful: `np.vstack(...).T` is (3,N); `set_data_3d(*arr)` unpacks rows → x, y, z. Current code does `ax.plot(*np.vstack([...]).T, ...)` which is the same unpacking. Good.\n\nKeep the answer focused: the question is conceptual — \"会不会叠\". Answer: 不会，只要不新建 artist；叠只发生在\"去掉 clear 但保留每帧 plot/fill\"。Then give the rule table + skeleton + a check.\n\nAlso note: `blit=False` 每帧整张重绘 ≠ 叠图。\n\nAlso mention: 有一个真正会\"叠\"的例外需要小心 —— `ax_img.fill` 和 `ax.img.text` 这类每次调用都 add_patch/add_artist 的 API。以及 `ax.plot` 的 Line3D。\n\nFinally: 如果 n_armors 未来可变,预分配 max 并 `set_visible(False)` 多余。\n\nChat mode note at the end."}
{"type": "final", "timestamp": 1793176540.6768267, "id": "bc7a8922ad51", "status": "completed", "summary": "## 不会，除非你把“不 clear”和“每帧新建 artist”同时做\n\n需要分清两件事：\n\n| 现象 | 成因 |\n|---|---|\n| **帧重叠** | 每帧调用一次 `ax.plot()` / `ax_img.fill()` / `ax_img.annotate()`；每个调用都会往 axes 中**新增**一个 artist，旧的不删，于是画面越积越乱。 |\n| **整张重绘** | `blit=False`，每帧都会重画整块画布。它不叠加，只是把同一批 artist 按新坐标重画一遍。 |\n\n当前脚本靠 `clear()` 清空上一帧来避免“帧重叠”。方案 B 的做法正好相反：**不 clear，同时也不新建 artist**——所有 artist 在 `main` 里创建一次，之后每帧只调用它们的 setter 改数值。这样 artist 数量恒定，并不会越积越多。\n\n方案 B 之所以不是“只是删掉 clear()”：如果只删 `clear()` 而保留现有 `ax.plot()` 调用，100 帧后 `ax.lines` 里会有 1100 个 `Line3D`，画面会累积成残影，同时每个新 Line 都会触发 `_request_autoscale_view()`，比例尺又会跳动。\n\n## 每个调用对应的“建一次 / 改数值”\n\n| 现在每帧调用（第 87–124 行） | 方案 B：建一次 | 每帧更新 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `ax.plot(*np.vstack([o, o+L*R[:,i]]).T, ...)` | `ax.plot([], [], [], color=c, lw=2)[0]` | `set_data_3d(xs, ys, zs)` |\n| `ax.text(*origin, \"W\")` | `ax.text(0, 0, 0, \"W\")` → `Text3D` | `set_position_3d((x, y, z))` |\n| `ax.plot(plate_loop, color=\"#666666\")` | 4 条空 `Line3D` | `set_data_3d` |\n| `ax_img.fill(loop_u, loop_v, ...)` | 4 个 `Polygon` + `ax_img.add_patch` | `set_xy(np.c_[uu, vv])` + `set_visible(front[m])` |\n| `ax_img.plot(loop_u, loop_v, \"-\"/\":\")` | 4 条空 `Line2D` | `set_data(uu, vv)` + `set_linestyle(\"-\"/\":\")` |\n| `ax_img.annotate(...)` | 4 个 `ax_img.text(0, 0, f\"A{m}\")` | `set_position((uc, vc))` |\n| `ax.set_xlim/ylim/zlim`、`set_aspect`、`set_title` | 一次（`apply_cube` / `fixed`） | 不再调用 |\n\n对应的 build 骨架（形状和你现在的脚本一致，`n_armors=4` 固定，因此 artist 数量固定）：\n\n```python\ndef build(args, ax, ax2, ax_img, fixed):\n    a = {}\n    apply_cube(ax, fixed[\"ax\"]);  apply_cube(ax2, fixed[\"ax2\"])\n    ax_img.set_xlim(fixed[\"img\"][0], fixed[\"img\"][1])\n    ax_img.set_ylim(fixed[\"img\"][2], fixed[\"img\"][3])\n    ax_img.set_aspect(\"equal\")\n\n    # 3D：W / C / B 每个 3 条轴 + 1 个标签\n    a[\"frames\"]  = [[ax.plot([], [], [], color=c, lw=2)[0] for c in AXIS_COLORS]\n                    for _ in range(3)]\n    a[\"flabels\"] = [ax.text(0, 0, 0, s, fontsize=8) for s in (\"W\", \"C\", \"B\")]\n    a[\"plates\"]  = [ax.plot([], [], [], color=\"#666666\", lw=1.0)[0] for _ in range(4)]\n\n    # close-up：B + 4 套装甲轴\n    a[\"frames2\"]  = [[ax2.plot([], [], [], color=c, lw=2)[0] for c in AXIS_COLORS]\n                     for _ in range(5)]\n    a[\"flabels2\"] = [ax2.text(0, 0, 0, s, fontsize=8)\n                     for s in (\"B\", \"A0\", \"A1\", \"A2\", \"A3\")]\n    a[\"plates2\"]  = [ax2.plot([], [], [], color=ARMOR_COLORS[m], lw=1.2)[0]\n                     for m in range(4)]\n\n    # 2D：填充 + 轮廓 + 标签\n    a[\"fills\"] = []\n    for m in range(4):\n        p = Polygon(np.zeros((4, 2)), closed=True, facecolor=ARMOR_COLORS[m],\n                    alpha=0.35, lw=0, zorder=1)\n        ax_img.add_patch(p)\n        a[\"fills\"].append(p)\n    a[\"edges\"] = [ax_img.plot([], [], color=ARMOR_COLORS[m], lw=1.2, zorder=2)[0]\n                  for m in range(4)]\n    a[\"tags\"]  = [ax_img.text(0, 0, f\"A{m}\", fontsize=8, zorder=3) for m in range(4)]\n    return a\n```\n\n`update` 里就只剩“读取第 i 帧 → setter”，没有任何 `plot` / `fill` / `annotate` / `clear`。\n\n## 三个容易忽略的注意点\n\n1. **`ax_img.fill()` 和 `ax_img.annotate()` 是“每次调用都会新增 artist”的 API**，最容易造成帧重叠；方案 B 里必须换成 `Polygon` + `text` 的复用写法。`annotate` 返回的是 `Annotation`，虽然也能 `set_position`，但直接使用 `text` 更简单。\n2. **保持引用**：这些 artist 必须被某个长期对象（`a` 字典 → `build()` 的返回值 → 被 `on_frame` 闭包捕获）引用着；否则 GC 回收后画面上什么都不显示。\n3. **`n_armors` 一旦可变**（比如以后切换 3 板/4 板），就按上限预建、多余用 `set_visible(False)` 隐藏，而不是按帧增减——这是“不 clear”写法唯一的结构性约束。\n\n## 怎么确认没在叠加\n\n在 `on_frame` 里每隔 20 帧打印一次：\n\n```python\nprint(len(ax.lines), len(ax2.lines), len(ax_img.lines), len(ax_img.patches))\n```\n\n方案 B 下这四个数字**必须每帧完全不变**（示例配置里约 `11 / 16 / 4 / 4`）。如果数字在涨，说明还有代码路径在新建 artist，或者某处又调用了 `plot()`。\n\n顺带：3D 那边 `Line3D.set_data_3d()` 只修改 `_verts3d` 并标记 `stale`，**不会**触发 autoscale（`art3d.py:319`），所以“不 clear + 只改数据”之后，`set_xlim/ylim/zlim` 一次就够，比例尺自然不再跳动。\n\n---\n\n我在 chat（只读）模式，只能给到骨架。要不要我直接把 `scripts/visualize_target.py` 重构成 `build()` + `refresh()`（不 clear、不新建 artist、limits 一次定死、保留你现在的实际时间跳帧），切到 work mode 我就动手改，并用上面那四个计数 + `get_xlim()` 前后对比来验证。"}
