ee three panels roughly. Let me also verify the figure aspect and that the plot isn't clipped.\n\nAlso: run a timing test of actual render cost per frame to report. In the harness I can time `fig.canvas.draw()` per frame. Let me measure average draw time at dpi 100, 1650×520.\n\nAlso verify `plt.show()` path works interactively? Can't test GUI. But at least no error.\n\nLet me also check that `--duration`/`--fps` invalid triggers p.error.\n\nThen check the PNG."}
