{"type": "tool_call", "timestamp": 1793178110.1952295, "id": "3ef58d75f515", "name": "run_command", "arguments": "{\"command\": \"cd /home/fanshu/Workspace/qianli_auto_aim_simulation && sed -n '1180,1270p' .venv/lib/python3.11/site-packages/matplotlib/animation.py\"}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_ET_CmYWyXGqm3TbZvpo2sEp4849", "ui": {"group": null, "chip": "name", "summary": "", "preview": "command", "header": "", "form": "block", "body": "text", "collapse": "never", "highlight": "", "chrome": "", "mutates": true, "undo": false}, "path_arg": ""}
{"type": "tool_result", "timestamp": 1793178110.2105014, "id": "607d7ec63f2e", "tool_call_id": "call_00_ET_CmYWyXGqm3TbZvpo2sEp4849", "content": "OK: command succeeded\nstdout:\n    def _init_draw(self):\n        # Initial draw to clear the frame. Also used by the blitting code\n        # when a clean base is required.\n        self._draw_was_started = True\n\n    def _pre_draw(self, framedata, blit):\n        # Perform any cleaning or whatnot before the drawing of the frame.\n        # This default implementation allows blit to clear the frame.\n        if blit:\n            self._blit_clear(self._drawn_artists)\n\n    def _draw_frame(self, framedata):\n        # Performs actual drawing of the frame.\n        raise NotImplementedError('Needs to be implemented by subclasses to'\n                                  ' actually make an animation.')\n\n    def _post_draw(self, framedata, blit):\n        # After the frame is rendered, this handles the actual flushing of\n        # the draw, which can be a direct draw_idle() or make use of the\n        # blitting.\n        if blit and self._drawn_artists:\n            self._blit_draw(self._drawn_artists)\n        else:\n            self._fig.canvas.draw_idle()\n\n    # The rest of the code in this class is to facilitate easy blitting\n    def _blit_draw(self, artists):\n        # Handles blitted drawing, which renders only the artists given instead\n        # of the entire figure.\n        updated_ax = {a.axes for a in artists}\n        # Enumerate artists to cache Axes backgrounds. We do not draw\n        # artists yet to not cache foreground from plots with shared Axes\n        for ax in updated_ax:\n            # If we haven't cached the background for the current view of this\n            # Axes object, do so now. This might not always be reliable, but\n            # it's an attempt to automate the process.\n            cur_view = ax._get_view()\n            view, bg = self._blit_cache.get(ax, (object(), None))\n            if cur_view != view:\n                self._blit_cache[ax] = (\n                    cur_view, ax.figure.canvas.copy_from_bbox(ax.bbox))\n        # Make a separate pass to draw foreground.\n        for a in artists:\n            a.axes.draw_artist(a)\n        # After rendering all the needed artists, blit each Axes individually.\n        for ax in updated_ax:\n            ax.figure.canvas.blit(ax.bbox)\n\n    def _blit_clear(self, artists):\n        # Get a list of the Axes that need clearing from the artists that\n        # have been drawn. Grab the appropriate saved background from the\n        # cache and restore.\n        axes = {a.axes for a in artists}\n        for ax in axes:\n            try:\n                view, bg = self._blit_cache[ax]\n            except KeyError:\n                continue\n            if ax._get_view() == view:\n                ax.figure.canvas.restore_region(bg)\n            else:\n                self._blit_cache.pop(ax)\n\n    def _setup_blit(self):\n        # Setting up the blit requires: a cache of the background for the Axes\n        self._blit_cache = dict()\n        self._drawn_artists = []\n        # _post_draw needs to be called first to initialize the renderer\n        self._post_draw(None, self._blit)\n        # Then we need to clear the Frame for the initial draw\n        # This is typically handled in _on_resize because QT and Tk\n        # emit a resize event on launch, but the macosx backend does not,\n        # thus we force it here for everyone for consistency\n        self._init_draw()\n        # Connect to future resize events\n        self._resize_id = self._fig.canvas.mpl_connect('resize_event',\n                                                       self._on_resize)\n\n    def _on_resize(self, event):\n        # On resize, we need to disable the resize event handling so we don't\n        # get too many events. Also stop the animation events, so that\n        # we're paused. Reset the cache and re-init. Set up an event handler\n        # to catch once the draw has actually taken place.\n        self._fig.canvas.mpl_disconnect(self._resize_id)\n        self.event_source.stop()\n        self._blit_cache.clear()\n        self._init_draw()\n        self._resize_id = self._fig.canvas.mpl_connect('draw_event',\n                                                       self._end_redraw)\n\n    def _end_redraw(self, event):\n", "is_error": false, "diff": ""}
{"type": "compaction", "timestamp": 1793178137.4389277, "id": "e4edff784ed8", "summary": "## Objective\n- 让 `scripts/visualize_target.py` 在保持各面板比例尺固定的前提下尽量简单（无 argparse、无工程化结构、可读性最好），并继续降低每帧延迟。用户最后说“改”，因此已按 blit 方案改完，剩下验证 blit 的正确性并汇报。\n\n## Important Details\n- 仓库根：`/home/fanshu/Workspace/qianli_auto_aim_simulation`；运行用 `.venv/bin/python`（mpl 3.11.2、numpy 2.4.6、torch、py3.11）。venv 里无 `pip`，uv 在 `/home/fanshu/.local/bin/uv`。\n- 用 heredoc 写脚本时内容里禁含 `'`；临时脚本用 `write_file` 写 `/tmp/*.py` 再 `.venv/bin/python /tmp/x.py`。\n- 用户偏好：极简、不要 CLI/类型注解/import 工程化；参数用文件顶部常量；行宽 ≤ 79。\n- 脚本现为顶层脚本（无 `main()`、无 `if __name__`），常量：`DISTANCE=3.0, HEIGHT=0.5, RADIUS=0.3, YAW=0.0, CAM_YAW=0.0, FX=800.0, IMAGE_W/IMAGE_H=1280/1024, SECONDS=10.0, FPS=60.0, ARMOR_COLORS(4 项), AXIS_COLORS(x红/y绿/z蓝), N_ARMORS=len(ARMOR_COLORS)`。\n- 函数：`camera_rotation, project, closed, set_cube, line3d, text3d, triad, place, update, animate`；模块级 `CAM_POS, BODY_POS, R_WC, N_FRAMES=max(2,round(SECONDS*FPS)), track, corners/centers/body_rot/armor_rot, fig, ax_world/ax_armor/ax_image, world_frames, armor_frames, world_plates, armor_plates, fills/edges/tags, cubes, px_per_m, half, u_all/v_all, moving, start, animation`。\n- 比例尺固定：`set_cube()` 用整段 `corners` 并集 + `cam_pos`/原点(pad 0.1)、body(pad 0.15)，三个 axes `set_autoscale_on(False)`；相机面板 `px_per_m = FX/DISTANCE`、`half=(RADIUS+0.25)*px_per_m`、中心取整段投影均值（实测 3 m: x[493.33,786.67] y[365.34,658.67]、267 px/m；6 m: 133 px/m、窗口 147 px；cam_yaw 30 中心 x=1105）。\n- 墙钟跳帧保留：`index = min(int((perf_counter()-start)/SECONDS*N_FRAMES), N_FRAMES-1)`；末帧 `if index == N_FRAMES-1 and animation.event_source is not None: animation.event_source.stop()`（TkAgg 下动画停但窗口留）。\n- Pylance/pyright 事实：`Axes3D.plot`/`Axes3D.text`（`axes3d.py:2224`/`2182`）无返回注解 → 推断为 `Line2D`/`Text`；运行时 `art3d.line_2d_to_3d`（`art3d.py:392`）、`text_2d_to_3d`（`art3d.py:261`）直接改 `__class__`。`mpl_toolkits` 无 `py.typed` → `Line3D` 在 pyright 里是 Unknown。因此用 `assert isinstance(...)` 窄化，兼作运行期自证；`line3d` 的 `lw` 默认必须写 `2.0`（写 `2` 会被推断 int，传 1.0/1.2 报 float→int）。\n- pyright 验证法（不污染仓库）：`uv pip install --target /tmp/pylib pyright`；`PYTHONPATH=/tmp/pylib /tmp/pylib/bin/pyright --pythonpath .venv/bin/python scripts/visualize_target.py` → 现为 0 errors。验证配置有效性的办法：删掉两个 `assert` 后能复现 *Cannot access attribute \"set_data_3d\" for class \"Line2D\"*。\n- 性能实测（Agg，中位数）：`update()` 0.35–0.42 ms；整幅 `fig.canvas.draw()` **95.7 ms**（dpi 60/80/100 无差别）；`ax_world.draw` 31.3、`ax_armor.draw` 37.2、`ax_image.draw` 20.7 ms；52 个 artist 单独重画 12.7 ms；手写 blit 帧 13.7 ms；`grid(False)` 87.1；pane 隐藏 87.0（pane 几乎不耗时）；`set_axis_off()` 43.7（世界 8.7 / 装甲 10.0，说明刻度+网格+标签约 22 ms/面板）。\n- 已实现 blit：`FuncAnimation(..., blit=True, cache_frame_data=False)`，`animate()` 返回 52 元素的 `moving` 列表；实测 `FuncAnimation._step()` **12.3 ms**（vs 95.7 → ≈7.8×），`ani._blit=True`、`_drawn_artists` 52、background 已缓存。\n- **未解决的疑点**：同一 index 下 blit 帧与整幅重绘差 ~0.5% 像素（max diff 255），差异集中在行 212–315 带；图像面板 tag 文本 A0 285 / A1 123 / A2 102 / A3 244 diff px，两个 3D 面板各有 780/1939 diff px。怀疑是缓存背景里烘进了第 0 帧 artist（ghost），或文本/Line3D 经 `ax.draw_artist` 合成方式不同。注意 `full(i+1) vs full(i)` 只有 0.000%（相邻帧位移小于阈值，不能当对照组）。\n- mpl blit 内部：`Animation._pre_draw`（`animation.py:1185`）调 `_blit_clear`；`_post_draw`（`1196`）→ `_blit_draw`（`1206`）；`_blit_cache.get(ax, ...)` 在 `1217–1219` 按 axes 缓存区域。\n- `diff_env/target.py`：`ArmorLayout.forward(..., roll=math.pi*5/12)`、`euler_to_rotmat(yaws + half_pi, zeros, rolls)`；`TargetMotion.forward` 返回 `corners/centers/armor_yaws/armor_rotations/body_rotations`；`yaw_rate=torch.tensor([3.0])`（3 rad/s）。\n- `fix-vis.clc`（既存 M，勿动）、`pyproject.toml`、`uv.lock` 勿改。`git status --short` 目前只有 ` M fix-vis.clc` 与 ` M scripts/visualize_target.py`。\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- 脚本按用户要求彻底简化为顶层常量脚本（约 218 行，所有行 ≤79 列），删除 `argparse`/`main()`/`build()`/`draw()`/`art` dict/`clock` dict/类型注解/`--out`/`--dpi`；artist 只建一次，之后只 `set_data_3d`/`set_position_3d`/`set_xy`/`set_data`/`set_position`/`set_visible`/`set_linestyle`。\n- 修掉两轮 Pylance 报错：①`fixed` 字典值类型（旧版代码，已随重写消失）→ 曾用 `dict[str, tuple[float, ...]]`；②`Line2D` 无 `set_data_3d` → 新增 `line3d()`/`text3d()` 助手（`from mpl_toolkits.mplot3d.art3d import Line3D, Text3D` + `assert isinstance`），pyright 校验 0 errors。\n- 加入 blit：`moving` 列表（3D 两面板的 triad lines+关注 32 个 + 4 个 world_plates + 4 个 armor_plates + fills/edges/tags 各 4 = 52）、`animate()` 返回 `moving`、`blit=True`、docstring 写明“~14 ms/帧 vs ~95 ms”。\n- headless 验证（`/tmp/check_simple.py`）：artist 计数恒 `(13,19,4,4)`、13 个采样帧 + 多次 `canvas.draw()` 后 limits 完全相同、板宽 29.2→11.9 px、轴 2 点/板 5 点闭环/填充 5 点、标签 `W/C/B`+`A0..A3`、每帧 2 个实线填充、`animate` 在 `start` 回拨 0.5 倍时长后与 `update(300)` 逐点相同、回拨 2 倍触发 stop。\n- 常量变换验证（`/tmp/check_consts.py`）：6 m → 133 px/m、板宽比 1.91；cam_yaw 30 窗口中心 x=1105。\n- 真后端验证：tkagg + `DISPLAY=:0`，SECONDS=2 版本无异常，约 4.8 s CPU 后空闲（说明动画确实停），整幅重绘 ~94 ms。\n\n### Active\n- 正在排查 blit 帧与整幅重绘之间 ~0.5% 的像素差异（tag 文本 + 两个 3D 面板中带）；最后一步是读 `matplotlib/animation.py:1180–1270` 的 `_pre_draw`/`_post_draw`/`_blit_draw`/`_blit_cache` 以确认缓存背景是否含第 0 帧 artist。\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)（仅上述 blit 差异待定，不阻塞使用：去掉 `blit=True` 即回退到 95.7 ms 全重绘）\n\n## Next Move\n1. 判定 ~0.5% 差异来源：在整幅重绘前把 `moving` 里的 artist 临时 `set_visible(False)`（或 `set_animated(True)`）再 `copy_from_bbox` 取干净背景，重跑 `/tmp/check_blit2.py` 比对；若差异归零即为 ghost，若仍在则检查 `ax.draw_artist()` 对 `Text3D`/`Line2D` 文本合成的差异，必要时把 4 个 `A#` tag 从 blit 列表剔除（改为随背景烘焙，代价是标签不再随板移动）。\n2. 向用户汇报：简化后的结构（常量 + `line3d/text3d` + `moving`）、blit 前/后每帧 95.7 ms → 12.3 ms（≈7.8×，52 个 artist、`_step` 中位 12.3 ms）、`update()` 0.35 ms、`set_axis_off()` 可再降到 43.7 ms 但会失去刻度（未采用）；并说明仍需确认的 0.5% 像素差与 TkAgg 实跑观感。\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `scripts/visualize_target.py`：约 218 行极简顶层脚本，含 `line3d/text3d` 断言窄化、固定 limits、`moving` + `blit=True`。\n- `diff_env/target.py`：`ArmorLayout.forward`（`roll=math.pi*5/12`，`euler_to_rotmat(yaws+half_pi, zeros, rolls)`）、`TargetMotion.forward` 返回 `corners/centers/armor_yaws/armor_rotations/body_rotations`。\n- `diff_env/geometry.py`：`euler_to_rotmat = Rz @ Ry @ Rx`。\n- `/tmp/check_simple.py`：runpy + 打桩 `plt.show`/`FuncAnimation` 的 headless 主验证（artist 计数、limits、板宽、`animate` 帧号、stop、重绘耗时）。\n- `/tmp/check_consts.py`、`/tmp/check_px.py`：常量变换与像素配色校验。\n- `/tmp/prof.py`：分项耗时（update / 三个 axes / artists-only / blit / grid off / pane 隐藏 / axis off）。\n- `/tmp/check_blit.py`、`/tmp/check_blit2.py`、`/tmp/check_blit3.py`：blit 正确性比对（`_step` 耗时、逐帧 diff、diff 位置定位）。\n- `/tmp/pylib`（pyright 安装体）、`/tmp/pyrstrict`（pyright 配置与 `vis.py`/`bad.py`/`bad2.py` 实验副本）。\n- `fix-vis.clc`（既存 M，勿动）、`pyproject.toml`、`uv.lock`：与本任务无关。"}
