{"type": "tool_result", "timestamp": 1793179081.0087063, "id": "8af693a6b50f", "tool_call_id": "call_00_3Ul5ejvEvwzU4yW3ZDOS5568", "content": "OK: command succeeded\nstdout:\n31:        pos = p0.unsqueeze(1) + v.unsqueeze(1) * t_e + 0.5 * a.unsqueeze(1) * t_e**2\n34:            pos = pos + sinus_amp.unsqueeze(1) * torch.sin(\n41:            ) * rw_sigma.unsqueeze(1)\n57:        yaw = yaw_0.unsqueeze(1) + yaw_rate.unsqueeze(1) * t\n63:        pitch = pitch_0.unsqueeze(1).expand(-1, sln)\n69:        roll = roll_0.unsqueeze(1).expand(-1, sln)\n152:        if mode in (\"static\", \"constant_velocity\"):\n153:            n_armors = 1\n155:            n_armors = params.get(\"n_armors\", 4)\n", "is_error": false, "diff": ""}
{"type": "assistant_message", "timestamp": 1793179091.4293334, "id": "e668e208afde", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_vTMb6foMMMBPAaDpdRa75220", "name": "save_memory", "arguments": "{\"content\": \"diff_env/target.py 的 BodyMotion 轨迹公式（行 31-42）：pos = p0 + v·t + ½a·t² + A⊙sin(2πf t) + cumsum(randn·σ)，逐轴独立；速度 = v + a t + 2πf⊙A⊙cos(2πft)，加速度 = a − (2πf)²⊙A⊙sin(2πft)。所以支持：直线匀变速（a∥v）、平面抛物线（a∦v）、Lissajous/蛇形曲线（不同频率的正弦）、随机游走；即“曲线变速”是支持的。限制：①sin 无相位参数（相位恒 0），同频同幅的 x/y 只能沿固定方向直线往复，做不出标准圆周/椭圆；②加速度只能恒定或单频正弦，没有 S 曲线/梯形速度规划、无弧长参数化、无 jerk 控制、无法直接给任意轨迹点；③random walk 用 torch.randn 每次 forward 重采样且 cumsum 按帧而非 dt 累加 → 不可复现、依赖采样密度；④姿态只有 常数+线性+正弦（yaw 有 yaw_rate+yaw_amp），无随机项，也不跟随轨迹切线；⑤mode 只影响 n_armors（static/constant_velocity→1 板，其他→4 板），不区分运动类型。scripts/visualize_target.py 只传 p0/yaw_0/yaw_rate=3，所以画面上是原地自转。\", \"title\": \"TargetMotion 支持抛物线/正弦曲线变速，但无相位参数做不出圆周\"}"}], "reasoning": "Now write the answer.\n\nKey: not \"直线变速 only\". It supports quadratic (parabola) and sinusoidal (waves), plus random walk. But it cannot do arbitrary curves (no phase → no circle; no splines; no speed profile control).\n\nLet me be precise about the math.\n\npos(t) = p0 + v t + ½ a t² + A ⊙ sin(2π f t) + Σ randn·σ  (per-axis, elementwise ⊙)\n\nVelocity: v + a t + 2π f ⊙ A ⊙ cos(2π f t) + noise.\nAcceleration: a - (2π f)² ⊙ A ⊙ sin(2π f t).\n\nSo the trajectory is a general 3D curve whenever a is not parallel to v, or A ≠ 0. And speed |ṗ| varies → \"变速\". So 曲线变速 is definitely supported.\n\nCases:\n- a ∥ v, A=0 → 直线变速（匀变速）\n- a ∦ v, A=0 → 平面抛物线（曲线变速，加速度恒定但速度大小和方向都变）\n- v=0, a=0, A≠0 → 每个轴独立的周期摆动；同频同相 → 沿固定方向直线往复（此时是\"直线变速\"！）；不同频率 → Lissajous 曲线（曲线变速，且闭合）\n- v ≠ 0, A ≠ 0 → 正弦波/蛇形推进（曲线变速）\n- rw → 随机游走\n\nLimitation about circle: x=A sin(ωt), y=A sin(ωt) is colinear. For a circle need cos. Since phase is fixed at 0, ax_freq ratio 1:2 etc gives Lissajous. A true circle can be approximated with freq ratio near 1? No — Lissajous with f ratio p:q closes only for rational ratios; near-1 irrational gives dense non-closed path slowly drifting. Actually with same freq and equal amp, x=y → line regardless. So exact circle impossible; near-circle possible with e.g. f_x=1, f_y=1.0001? That gives a very slow drift... no, x=A sin(2πt), y=A sin(2π*1.0001 t) → phase difference grows slowly → the path traces a nearly-circle-ish shape over long time? At any time point, the point is on a Lissajous curve with a slowly varying phase diff — over the clip it sweeps an area; instantaneous path is not a circle and speed varies wildly. So: 不能。\n\nAlso mention: 可通过组合 v 和 a 得到抛物线，这是最常见的\"曲线变速\"。\n\nBut is \"曲线变速运动\" in the user's mind maybe about the *target's motion in the simulation* (e.g. 机器人真实运动，像 RoboMaster 的目标做圆弧绕行)? Then the answer: 支持二次曲线和 Lissajous 波，不支持圆弧/样条/任意速度剖面。\n\nAlso mention that mode parameter names: mode in (\"static\",\"constant_velocity\") → 1 armor; else 4. The mode does not gate motion.\n\nAlso mention rw caveats: `torch.randn` per call → 同 t 不同结果；cumsum over frames (not dt-weighted) → 步长 = rw_sigma per frame regardless of sln spacing → 依赖采样密度。\n\nAlso: 姿态 yaw 有线性+正弦 → 变速旋转 OK；pitch/roll 只有常数+正弦。\n\nAlso: 没有\"朝向跟随轨迹切线\"（body yaw 与运动方向解耦）。这对视觉真实性有影响。\n\nExtension sketch: add `sinus_phase` (or `sinus_cos`), e.g. shifting y by π/2 gives ellipse; add polynomial/spline; add per-frame positions override.\n\nGive a concrete table of params → trajectories. And a short \"how to add phase\" snippet (advisory only, since chat mode read-only).\n\nCareful: I shouldn't write files, but showing a code snippet as advice is fine.\n\nAlso point out the visualize_target.py scene only sets p0/yaw_0/yaw_rate → 原地自转，这才是\"看起来只会转\"的原因。\n\nLet me write the answer with a small table and formulas. Also maybe mermaid? Not necessary. Keep it focused.\n\nShould I save memory? Perhaps a durable fact: TargetMotion 支持 p0/v/a/sinus/random-walk，无相位参数 → 不能做标准圆周。That's a project/domain fact worth remembering. I'll save it — it's a real analysis result. Hmm, saving memory on every turn may be noisy, but the guidance says save durable facts. This is a codebase capability fact — moderately durable. I'll save one concise one.\n\nActually, maybe better to keep tool calls minimal; but the rule encourages recording. I'll save one."}
{"type": "tool_call", "timestamp": 1793179091.4292777, "id": "e0cd887c0786", "name": "save_memory", "arguments": "{\"content\": \"diff_env/target.py 的 BodyMotion 轨迹公式（行 31-42）：pos = p0 + v·t + ½a·t² + A⊙sin(2πf t) + cumsum(randn·σ)，逐轴独立；速度 = v + a t + 2πf⊙A⊙cos(2πft)，加速度 = a − (2πf)²⊙A⊙sin(2πft)。所以支持：直线匀变速（a∥v）、平面抛物线（a∦v）、Lissajous/蛇形曲线（不同频率的正弦）、随机游走；即“曲线变速”是支持的。限制：①sin 无相位参数（相位恒 0），同频同幅的 x/y 只能沿固定方向直线往复，做不出标准圆周/椭圆；②加速度只能恒定或单频正弦，没有 S 曲线/梯形速度规划、无弧长参数化、无 jerk 控制、无法直接给任意轨迹点；③random walk 用 torch.randn 每次 forward 重采样且 cumsum 按帧而非 dt 累加 → 不可复现、依赖采样密度；④姿态只有 常数+线性+正弦（yaw 有 yaw_rate+yaw_amp），无随机项，也不跟随轨迹切线；⑤mode 只影响 n_armors（static/constant_velocity→1 板，其他→4 板），不区分运动类型。scripts/visualize_target.py 只传 p0/yaw_0/yaw_rate=3，所以画面上是原地自转。\", \"title\": \"TargetMotion 支持抛物线/正弦曲线变速，但无相位参数做不出圆周\"}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_vTMb6foMMMBPAaDpdRa75220", "ui": {"group": null, "chip": "name", "summary": "", "preview": "args", "header": "", "form": "block", "body": "text", "collapse": "never", "highlight": "", "chrome": "", "mutates": false, "undo": false}, "path_arg": ""}
{"title": "TargetMotion 支持抛物线/正弦曲线变速，但无相位参数做不出圆周", "content": "diff_env/target.py 的 BodyMotion 轨迹公式（行 31-42）：pos = p0 + v·t + ½a·t² + A⊙sin(2πf t) + cumsum(randn·σ)，逐轴独立；速度 = v + a t + 2πf⊙A⊙cos(2πft)，加速度 = a − (2πf)²⊙A⊙sin(2πft)。所以支持：直线匀变速（a∥v）、平面抛物线（a∦v）、Lissajous/蛇形曲线（不同频率的正弦）、随机游走；即“曲线变速”是支持的。限制：①sin 无相位参数（相位恒 0），同频同幅的 x/y 只能沿固定方向直线往复，做不出标准圆周/椭圆；②加速度只能恒定或单频正弦，没有 S 曲线/梯形速度规划、无弧长参数化、无 jerk 控制、无法直接给任意轨迹点；③random walk 用 torch.randn 每次 forward 重采样且 cumsum 按帧而非 dt 累加 → 不可复现、依赖采样密度；④姿态只有 常数+线性+正弦（yaw 有 yaw_rate+yaw_amp），无随机项，也不跟随轨迹切线；⑤mode 只影响 n_armors（static/constant_velocity→1 板，其他→4 板），不区分运动类型。scripts/visualize_target.py 只传 p0/yaw_0/yaw_rate=3，所以画面上是原地自转。", "updated": 1793179091.5018258}
