{"type": "tool_result", "timestamp": 1793182414.2282722, "id": "9c4a738d2f79", "tool_call_id": "call_00_xxBcsqydo9QJ59vTPZCk7938", "content": "OK: command succeeded\nstdout:\nimport torch\n\n\ndef euler_to_rotmat(\n    yaw: torch.Tensor, pitch: torch.Tensor, roll: torch.Tensor\n) -> torch.Tensor:\n    cy, sy = torch.cos(yaw), torch.sin(yaw)\n    cp, sp = torch.cos(pitch), torch.sin(pitch)\n    cr, sr = torch.cos(roll), torch.sin(roll)\n\n    zero = torch.zeros_like(cy)\n    one = torch.ones_like(cy)\n\n    Rz = torch.stack(\n        [\n            torch.stack([cy, -sy, zero], dim=-1),\n            torch.stack([sy, cy, zero], dim=-1),\n            torch.stack([zero, zero, one], dim=-1),\n        ],\n        dim=-2,\n    )\n\n    Ry = torch.stack(\n        [\n            torch.stack([cp, zero, sp], dim=-1),\n            torch.stack([zero, one, zero], dim=-1),\n            torch.stack([-sp, zero, cp], dim=-1),\n        ],\n        dim=-2,\n    )\n\n    Rx = torch.stack(\n        [\n            torch.stack([one, zero, zero], dim=-1),\n            torch.stack([zero, cr, -sr], dim=-1),\n            torch.stack([zero, sr, cr], dim=-1),\n        ],\n        dim=-2,\n    )\n\n    return Rz @ Ry @ Rx\n\n\ndef rvec_to_rotmat(rvec: torch.Tensor, eps: float = 1e-8) -> torch.Tensor:\n    theta = torch.norm(rvec, dim=-1, keepdim=True).clamp_min(eps)\n    k = rvec / theta\n\n    K = torch.zeros(*rvec.shape[:-1], 3, 3, device=rvec.device, dtype=rvec.dtype)\n    K[..., 0, 1] = -k[..., 2]\n    K[..., 0, 2] = k[..., 1]\n    K[..., 1, 0] = k[..., 2]\n    K[..., 1, 2] = -k[..., 0]\n    K[..., 2, 0] = -k[..., 1]\n    K[..., 2, 1] = k[..., 0]\n\n    sin_t = torch.sin(theta).unsqueeze(-1)\n    cos_t = torch.cos(theta).unsqueeze(-1)\n    I = torch.eye(3, device=rvec.device, dtype=rvec.dtype).expand_as(K)\n\n    R = I + sin_t * K + (1.0 - cos_t) * (K @ K)\n    return R\n\n\ndef apply_transform(\n    R: torch.Tensor, t: torch.Tensor, points: torch.Tensor\n) -> torch.Tensor:\n    rotated = points @ R.mT\n    return rotated + t.unsqueeze(-2)\n\n\ndef project_to_normalized(points_cam: torch.Tensor, eps: float = 1e-6) -> torch.Tensor:\n    z = points_cam[..., 2:3].clamp_min(eps)\n    xn = points_cam[..., 0:1] / z\n    yn = points_cam[..., 1:2] / z\n    return torch.cat([xn, yn], dim=-1)\n\n\ndef compute_az_el(points_gimbal: torch.Tensor, eps: float = 1e-8) -> torch.Tensor:\n    x = points_gimbal[..., 0]\n    y = points_gimbal[..., 1]\n    z = points_gimbal[..., 2]\n\n    az = torch.atan2(x, y)\n    horizontal = torch.sqrt(x * x + y * y).clamp_min(eps)\n    el = torch.atan2(z, horizontal)\n    return torch.stack([az, el], dim=-1)\n", "is_error": false, "diff": ""}
{"type": "tool_result", "timestamp": 1793182414.241136, "id": "633d2c63e325", "tool_call_id": "call_01_R0Njxo8qELD7imyr8AeG5956", "content": "OK: command succeeded\nstdout:\n        if height_offsets is None:\n            height_offsets = torch.zeros(\n                bsz, n_armors, device=device, dtype=radius.dtype\n            )\n\n        theta = (\n            torch.arange(n_armors, device=device, dtype=radius.dtype)\n            * 2\n            * math.pi\n            / n_armors\n        )\n\n        r_eff = radius.unsqueeze(-1) + radius_offsets\n        local_x = r_eff * torch.cos(theta)\n        local_y = r_eff * torch.sin(theta)\n        local_z = height_offsets\n        local_positions = torch.stack([local_x, local_y, local_z], dim=-1)\n\n        yaws = theta.unsqueeze(0).expand(bsz, -1)\n        # vertical armor: width tangential, height up, normal radial outward\n        zeros = torch.zeros_like(yaws)\n        rolls = torch.full_like(yaws, roll)\n        half_pi = torch.full_like(yaws, math.pi / 2)\n        local_rotations = euler_to_rotmat(yaws + half_pi, zeros, rolls)\n\n        w2 = self.armor_width / 2\n        h2 = self.armor_height / 2\n        corners_local = torch.tensor(\n            [\n                [-w2, -h2, 0.0],\n                [w2, -h2, 0.0],\n                [w2, h2, 0.0],\n                [-w2, h2, 0.0],\n            ],\n            device=device,\n            dtype=radius.dtype,\n        )\n\n        return local_positions, local_rotations, corners_local\n\n\nclass TargetMotion(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, armor_width: float = 0.12, armor_height: float = 0.06):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.body_motion = BodyMotion()\n        self.armor_layout = ArmorLayout(armor_width, armor_height)\n\n    def forward(self, t, mode=\"static\", **params):\n        bsz, _ = t.shape\n        device = t.device\n\n        if mode in (\"static\", \"constant_velocity\"):\n            n_armors = 1\n        else:\n            n_armors = params.get(\"n_armors\", 4)\n\n        radius = params.get(\"radius\", None)\n        if radius is None:\n            radius = torch.full((bsz,), 0.2, device=device, dtype=t.dtype)\n        elif not isinstance(radius, torch.Tensor):\n            radius = torch.full((bsz,), float(radius), device=device, dtype=t.dtype)\n\n        radius_offsets = params.get(\"armor_radius_offsets\", None)\n        height_offsets = params.get(\"armor_height_offsets\", None)\n\n        body = self.body_motion(t, params)\n        body_pos = body[\"positions\"]\n        body_rot = body[\"rotations\"]\n\n        local_pos, local_rot, corners_local = self.armor_layout(\n            n_armors, radius, radius_offsets, height_offsets\n", "is_error": false, "diff": ""}
{"type": "assistant_message", "timestamp": 1793182419.866387, "id": "c0fd4f26c165", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_I44JSaN2PPkptWqmIFGm1060", "name": "run_command", "arguments": "{\"command\": \"sed -n 170,215p diff_env/target.py\"}"}], "reasoning": "Good, all facts confirmed. Now write the answer.\n\nKey content:\n1. body_rot 不是\"理论上无角速度\"——脚本显式给了角速度：`YAW_RATE = 5.0` in rad/s (line 34) and `yaw_rate=torch.tensor([YAW_RATE])` (line 116), plus `yaw_rate_amp=0.5, yaw_rate_freq=0.3` (117-118).\n2. BodyMotion 的默认值确实是 0（`_get(\"yaw_rate\", ...)` default 0.0），但脚本覆盖了。所以你看到的转动 = 你自己传的那一行。\n3. 5 rad/s = 286°/s ≈ 0.8 圈/秒 → 60fps 下每帧 4.8°，看着就是平稳自转；pitch/roll 都是 0（未传 amp），所以只有绕 z 的 yaw。R = Rz@Ry@Rx = Rz(yaw)。\n4. 为什么\"看不出来是 yaw 在带 4 块板一起转\"：4 板 90° 等分，环布局本身 4 重对称；纯 yaw 旋转时板的**位置集合**只在 90° 跳变时才变样（其实连续变，只是对称），但 tag A0..A3 的顺序/位置会绕着圈走，triad B 的 x/y 轴会扫过。所以可见的旋转就是 B triad 和标签。\n5. 而且 `yaw_rate_amp` 那一项是**bug**：代码没有积分。`yaw = yaw_0 + yaw_rate·t` 而 `yaw_rate = rate0 + amp·sin(2πft)`，所以\n   yaw(t) = yaw_0 + (rate0 + amp·sin(2πft))·t\n   有效角速度 ω(t) = rate0 + amp·sin(2πft) + 2πf·amp·t·cos(2πft)\n   在 amp=0.5, f=0.3 → 第三项 = 0.9425·t rad/s，t=100 时 ±94 rad/s ≈ 15 圈/秒。也就是说片尾那段自转是\"越转越快 + 抖动\"的假象，不是模型想表达的匀角速度或正弦调制角速度。正确写法应是积分：yaw = yaw_0 + rate0·t + amp/(2πf)·(1 − cos(2πft))。\n   用表格给出数字。\n6. 想让 body 无角速度：yaw_rate=0（并去掉 yaw_rate_amp/freq，或把它们设为 0）。注意 `_get` 里对 yaw_rate_amp 有门控 `if abs().sum() > 0`，所以设 0 就跳过。\n   代码片段 diff.\n7. 另外提醒 body_rot 仍然会因 sinus 平移而变化吗？不 — 平移不影响 rotations。rotations 只由 yaw/pitch/roll 决定。所以\"理论无角速度\"只有在把三个 rate/amp 置 0 时成立。\n8. 顺带: BODY_POS 常量问题——有 sinus 平移 ±0.2 m 时 B triad 不跟随（line 107/182-183），所以你在 world 面板看到 B 帧固定在 3 m 处自转，而板圈在 ±0.2 m 内摆动，两者脱开。修法 `body_pos = track[\"positions\"][0].numpy()`？Wait — TargetMotion returns what keys? Let me check the return dict keys of TargetMotion to see if positions/body_rotations are there.\n\nLet me check the end of TargetMotion.forward."}
{"type": "tool_call", "timestamp": 1793182419.866326, "id": "25cf01a622de", "name": "run_command", "arguments": "{\"command\": \"sed -n 170,215p diff_env/target.py\"}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_I44JSaN2PPkptWqmIFGm1060", "ui": {"group": null, "chip": "name", "summary": "", "preview": "command", "header": "", "form": "block", "body": "text", "collapse": "never", "highlight": "", "chrome": "", "mutates": true, "undo": false}, "path_arg": ""}
{"type": "tool_result", "timestamp": 1793182419.8805044, "id": "857dd5ff2c02", "tool_call_id": "call_00_I44JSaN2PPkptWqmIFGm1060", "content": "OK: command succeeded\nstdout:\n            n_armors, radius, radius_offsets, height_offsets\n        )\n\n        centers = body_pos.unsqueeze(2) + torch.einsum(\n            \"btij,bmj->btmi\", body_rot, local_pos\n        )\n        world_rot = torch.einsum(\"btik,bmkj->btmij\", body_rot, local_rot)\n        corners = centers.unsqueeze(-2) + torch.einsum(\n            \"btmij,cj->btmci\", world_rot, corners_local\n        )\n        # facing direction of each plate: local +Z is the plate normal\n        normal_local = torch.tensor([0.0, 0.0, 1.0], device=device, dtype=radius.dtype)\n        world_normal = torch.einsum(\"btmij,j->btmi\", world_rot, normal_local)\n        armor_yaws = torch.atan2(world_normal[..., 1], world_normal[..., 0])\n\n        return {\n            \"corners\": corners,\n            \"centers\": centers,\n            \"armor_yaws\": armor_yaws,\n            \"armor_rotations\": world_rot,\n            \"body_rotations\": body_rot,\n        }\n", "is_error": false, "diff": ""}
{"type": "assistant_message", "timestamp": 1793182433.3378842, "id": "c347b04ca146", "content": "## 直接回答：`body_rot` 确实有角速度，是脚本显式传入的\n\n`BodyMotion` 的**默认**角速度确实是 0（`_get` 的 default 是 `0.0`），但它允许通过参数覆盖；而 `scripts/visualize_target.py` 在第 111–123 行传入的正是这些覆盖参数：\n\n```python\n# line 34\nYAW_RATE = 5.0                                     # rad/s（这行没写单位）\n\n# line 115-118\nyaw_0=torch.tensor([math.radians(YAW)]),\nyaw_rate=torch.tensor([YAW_RATE]),                 # ← 5.0 rad/s\nyaw_rate_amp=torch.tensor([0.5]),\nyaw_rate_freq=torch.tensor([0.3]),\n```\n\n`diff_env/target.py:57` 把它变成姿态：\n\n```python\nyaw = yaw_0.unsqueeze(1) + yaw_rate * t\n...\nrotations = euler_to_rotmat(yaw, pitch, roll)      # Rz @ Ry @ Rx，pitch=roll=0\n```\n\n也就是说，**body 正在绕世界 +Z 轴以 5 rad/s 匀速转动**：286°/s、0.8 圈/秒、每帧 4.77°（在 60 fps 下），转一圈 1.26 s。在动画中表现为平稳自转。而在 100 s 的片长里，它转了 500 rad ≈ **79.6 圈**。\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\nA[\"yaw_rate = 5 + 0.5·sin(0.6πt)\"] --> B[\"yaw = yaw_0 + rate·t\"]\nB --> C[\"R = Rz(yaw) (pitch=roll=0)\"]\nC --> D[\"body_rotations\"]\nD --> E[\"B 坐标架: place(..., BODY_POS, body_rot[i])\"]\nD --> F[\"centers / armor_rotations\"]\n```\n\n“理论上不该有角速度”这个前提，只在 `yaw_rate = yaw_rate_amp = 0`（`pitch_amp`、`roll_amp` 本来就是 0）时成立。注意 **平移不产生旋转**：`BodyMotion.forward` 里 `positions` 和 `rotations` 是两条并列分支，`sinus_amp=[0.2,0.2,0.2]` 只改 `positions`，`rotations` 只由 yaw/pitch/roll 决定。所以可视化里看到的旋转**不可能**来自 `sinus_amp`，只能来自 `yaw_rate`。\n\n## 顺带指出一个真正的 bug：`yaw_rate_amp` 没有被积分，而是直接乘了 `t`\n\n`target.py:56-58`：\n\n```python\nif yaw_rate_amp.abs().sum() > 0:\n    yaw_rate = yaw_rate + yaw_rate_amp.unsqueeze(1) * torch.sin(2π·f·t)\nyaw = yaw_0.unsqueeze(1) + yaw_rate * t          # ← 整段 rate 乘 t\n```\n\n展开就是\n\n$$yaw(t) = yaw_0 + \\big(r_0 + A\\sin 2\\pi f t\\big)\\,t$$\n\n对时间求导，得到真实角速度：\n\n$$\\omega(t) = r_0 + A\\sin 2\\pi f t + 2\\pi f A\\,t\\cos 2\\pi f t$$\n\n把 $A=0.5$, $f=0.3$ 代入第三项：$2\\pi f A\\,t = 0.9425\\,t$ rad/s。\n\n| $t$ (s) | 该项幅值 (rad/s) | 折算 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | ±0.94 | ±54°/s（还能看出是“调速”） |\n| 10 | ±9.4 | ±540°/s |\n| 50 | ±47 | ±2700°/s |\n| 100 | ±94 | ±5400° ≈ 15 圈/秒 |\n\n在 60 fps 下，每帧 1.57 rad 已经超过奈奎斯特频率，因此会表现为**随机抖动**。所以片尾那段“乱转”并不是模型有意设计出的运动，而是这个写法造成的假象（`SECONDS=100` 把它放大了 100 倍才会这么明显）。\n\n若想要“匀角速度 + 正弦调制角速度”，必须积分：\n\n```python\nyaw = yaw_0.unsqueeze(1) + yaw_rate * t + (\n    yaw_rate_amp / (2 * math.pi * yaw_rate_freq)\n    * (1.0 - torch.cos(2 * math.pi * yaw_rate_freq * t))\n)\n```\n\n（$yaw$ 的调制项幅值上限是 $A/(2\\pi f)$，与 `t` 无关。）\n\n## 如果确实需要让 body 零角速度\n\n把第 116–118 行整体去掉即可；`_get` 会让 `yaw_rate`、`yaw_rate_amp` 都取 0，从而 `yaw = yaw_0` 恒定，`body_rot` 变成常量 $R_z(yaw_0)$：\n\n```python\nyaw_0=torch.tensor([math.radians(YAW)]),\n# 不传 yaw_rate / yaw_rate_amp / yaw_rate_freq\n```\n\n这时可视化会变成“板圈固定朝向、整体做 `sinus` 平移（±0.2 m）”。\n\n## 为什么“看起来只有 B 坐标架在转”，而 4 块板像没动\n\n`ArmorLayout` 把 4 块板放在 $\\theta = 0°, 90°, 180°, 270°$，环本身是 4 重对称的。body yaw 连续改变时，板的**位置集合**几乎不变（只是在 90° 附近整体换位），所以肉眼只能从三处看出转动：\n\n1. `world`/`armor` 两个 3D 面板里的 **B 坐标架** `place(..., BODY_POS, body_rot[index])`（第 183 行）；\n2. 图像面板里 `A0..A3` **标签**绕圈走（第 199 行）；\n3. 板的实线/虚线（正反面）在 8 个朝向附近翻转。\n\n这也解释了你的困惑：环的几何形状本身“骗”了眼睛，真正在转的是坐标架和标签。\n\n## 另外提醒一个与 `body_rot` 同目录的相关 bug\n\n因为 `sinus_amp=0.2` 让 `body_pos` 在 ±0.2 m 内摆动，但第 107 行的 `BODY_POS` 是**常量**，所以 `world` 面板里的 B 坐标架钉在 3 m 处自转，而板圈在 2.8–3.2 m 之间晃，两者**脱开**。`TargetMotion` 的返回字典里没有 `positions`（只有 `body_rotations`），所以修法是用对称环的中心反推：\n\n```python\nbody_pos = centers.mean(1)      # 环对称 => local_pos 均值为 0\n```\n\n然后把第 182–183、154 行的 `BODY_POS` 换成 `body_pos[index]`。\n\n---\n\n以上只是诊断。要真正改文件（去掉/积分 `yaw_rate`、让 B 坐标架跟随 `centers.mean(1)`、以及之前已经达成共识的有界 `sinus` 参数、文本坐标闸门、`project` 退化保护等）需要切到 **work 模式**——chat 模式下 `run_command` 只放行只读命令，我无法写盘也无法运行脚本。", "tool_calls": [], "reasoning": "No `positions` in the returned dict — only body_rotations. So `body_pos` isn't directly available; must use `centers.mean(1)` (since armors are symmetric: mean of local_pos = 0 for evenly spaced ring; with radius_offsets/height_offsets possibly nonzero but here zero). Good — consistent with earlier conclusion.\n\nNow write the answer. Include:\n\n- Direct answer: because the script asks for it.\n- Evidence with line numbers.\n- Table of contributions.\n- The amp-not-integrated bug with math and numbers.\n- How to get zero angular velocity.\n- Side note that yaw rate 5 rad/s × 100 s = 500 rad = 79.6 turns, plus wobble ±.\n- Note about symmetry masking.\n\nLet me compute some numbers precisely:\n- 5 rad/s = 286.5°/s; per frame at 60fps: 4.77°; period 2π/5 = 1.257 s.\n- 100 s → 500 rad = 79.58 revolutions.\n- amp term: amp=0.5 rad/s, f=0.3 Hz, 2πf=1.88496. ω_extra(t) = 0.5 sin(0.6πt) + 0.5·1.88496·t·cos(0.6πt) = 0.5 sin + 0.9425 t cos. At t=100: 94.2 rad/s.\n- yaw excursion from amp term at t: 0.5·sin(0.6πt)·t → max 50 rad at t=100.\n\nAlso worth noting: at t where 0.6πt = π/2 → t = 0.833 s, sin=1 → extra yaw = 0.5·0.833 = 0.42 rad. Small early; grows.\n\nAlso mermaid? Not needed. Maybe a small diagram of the sign chain? Could be nice but optional. I'll include a small code block instead. Maybe a tiny mermaid to show yaw rate → yaw → body_rot → triad/armors chain. Keep it light. Let's include one small mermaid since the UI renders it — but the rules: avoid nested quotes. I'll do:\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\nA[\"yaw_rate = 5 + 0.5 sin(0.6πt)\"] --> B[\"yaw = yaw_0 + rate·t\"]\nB --> C[\"euler_to_rotmat -> Rz(yaw)\"]\nC --> D[\"body_rotations\"]\nD --> E[\"B triad in both 3D panels\"]\nD --> F[\"armor centers/rotations\"]\n```\nThat's fine.\n\nAnswer in Chinese.\n\nAlso mention where the belief may come from: `BodyMotion` 默认 yaw_rate=0（`_get` default 0.0），所以\"不传就是 0\"是对的；但这个脚本传了。Maybe also mention earlier fact that sinus translation doesn't touch rotations.\n\nAlso I should mention how to verify: print `np.round(np.degrees(np.arctan2(body_rot[:,1,0], body_rot[:,0,0]))[:5])` — yaw extraction. That's readable, no need to run.\n\nAlso note: `YAW_RATE = 5.0` has no unit comment on the line (line 34 just `YAW_RATE = 5.0`) — mention should be rad/s.\n\nWrite it up."}
{"type": "final", "timestamp": 1793182433.3394458, "id": "4151cd6a11c9", "status": "completed", "summary": "## 直接回答：`body_rot` 确实有角速度，是脚本显式传入的\n\n`BodyMotion` 的**默认**角速度确实是 0（`_get` 的 default 是 `0.0`），但它允许通过参数覆盖；而 `scripts/visualize_target.py` 在第 111–123 行传入的正是这些覆盖参数：\n\n```python\n# line 34\nYAW_RATE = 5.0                                     # rad/s（这行没写单位）\n\n# line 115-118\nyaw_0=torch.tensor([math.radians(YAW)]),\nyaw_rate=torch.tensor([YAW_RATE]),                 # ← 5.0 rad/s\nyaw_rate_amp=torch.tensor([0.5]),\nyaw_rate_freq=torch.tensor([0.3]),\n```\n\n`diff_env/target.py:57` 把它变成姿态：\n\n```python\nyaw = yaw_0.unsqueeze(1) + yaw_rate * t\n...\nrotations = euler_to_rotmat(yaw, pitch, roll)      # Rz @ Ry @ Rx，pitch=roll=0\n```\n\n也就是说，**body 正在绕世界 +Z 轴以 5 rad/s 匀速转动**：286°/s、0.8 圈/秒、每帧 4.77°（在 60 fps 下），转一圈 1.26 s。在动画中表现为平稳自转。而在 100 s 的片长里，它转了 500 rad ≈ **79.6 圈**。\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\nA[\"yaw_rate = 5 + 0.5·sin(0.6πt)\"] --> B[\"yaw = yaw_0 + rate·t\"]\nB --> C[\"R = Rz(yaw) (pitch=roll=0)\"]\nC --> D[\"body_rotations\"]\nD --> E[\"B 坐标架: place(..., BODY_POS, body_rot[i])\"]\nD --> F[\"centers / armor_rotations\"]\n```\n\n“理论上不该有角速度”这个前提，只在 `yaw_rate = yaw_rate_amp = 0`（`pitch_amp`、`roll_amp` 本来就是 0）时成立。注意 **平移不产生旋转**：`BodyMotion.forward` 里 `positions` 和 `rotations` 是两条并列分支，`sinus_amp=[0.2,0.2,0.2]` 只改 `positions`，`rotations` 只由 yaw/pitch/roll 决定。所以可视化里看到的旋转**不可能**来自 `sinus_amp`，只能来自 `yaw_rate`。\n\n## 顺带指出一个真正的 bug：`yaw_rate_amp` 没有被积分，而是直接乘了 `t`\n\n`target.py:56-58`：\n\n```python\nif yaw_rate_amp.abs().sum() > 0:\n    yaw_rate = yaw_rate + yaw_rate_amp.unsqueeze(1) * torch.sin(2π·f·t)\nyaw = yaw_0.unsqueeze(1) + yaw_rate * t          # ← 整段 rate 乘 t\n```\n\n展开就是\n\n$$yaw(t) = yaw_0 + \\big(r_0 + A\\sin 2\\pi f t\\big)\\,t$$\n\n对时间求导，得到真实角速度：\n\n$$\\omega(t) = r_0 + A\\sin 2\\pi f t + 2\\pi f A\\,t\\cos 2\\pi f t$$\n\n把 $A=0.5$, $f=0.3$ 代入第三项：$2\\pi f A\\,t = 0.9425\\,t$ rad/s。\n\n| $t$ (s) | 该项幅值 (rad/s) | 折算 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | ±0.94 | ±54°/s（还能看出是“调速”） |\n| 10 | ±9.4 | ±540°/s |\n| 50 | ±47 | ±2700°/s |\n| 100 | ±94 | ±5400° ≈ 15 圈/秒 |\n\n在 60 fps 下，每帧 1.57 rad 已经超过奈奎斯特频率，因此会表现为**随机抖动**。所以片尾那段“乱转”并不是模型有意设计出的运动，而是这个写法造成的假象（`SECONDS=100` 把它放大了 100 倍才会这么明显）。\n\n若想要“匀角速度 + 正弦调制角速度”，必须积分：\n\n```python\nyaw = yaw_0.unsqueeze(1) + yaw_rate * t + (\n    yaw_rate_amp / (2 * math.pi * yaw_rate_freq)\n    * (1.0 - torch.cos(2 * math.pi * yaw_rate_freq * t))\n)\n```\n\n（$yaw$ 的调制项幅值上限是 $A/(2\\pi f)$，与 `t` 无关。）\n\n## 如果确实需要让 body 零角速度\n\n把第 116–118 行整体去掉即可；`_get` 会让 `yaw_rate`、`yaw_rate_amp` 都取 0，从而 `yaw = yaw_0` 恒定，`body_rot` 变成常量 $R_z(yaw_0)$：\n\n```python\nyaw_0=torch.tensor([math.radians(YAW)]),\n# 不传 yaw_rate / yaw_rate_amp / yaw_rate_freq\n```\n\n这时可视化会变成“板圈固定朝向、整体做 `sinus` 平移（±0.2 m）”。\n\n## 为什么“看起来只有 B 坐标架在转”，而 4 块板像没动\n\n`ArmorLayout` 把 4 块板放在 $\\theta = 0°, 90°, 180°, 270°$，环本身是 4 重对称的。body yaw 连续改变时，板的**位置集合**几乎不变（只是在 90° 附近整体换位），所以肉眼只能从三处看出转动：\n\n1. `world`/`armor` 两个 3D 面板里的 **B 坐标架** `place(..., BODY_POS, body_rot[index])`（第 183 行）；\n2. 图像面板里 `A0..A3` **标签**绕圈走（第 199 行）；\n3. 板的实线/虚线（正反面）在 8 个朝向附近翻转。\n\n这也解释了你的困惑：环的几何形状本身“骗”了眼睛，真正在转的是坐标架和标签。\n\n## 另外提醒一个与 `body_rot` 同目录的相关 bug\n\n因为 `sinus_amp=0.2` 让 `body_pos` 在 ±0.2 m 内摆动，但第 107 行的 `BODY_POS` 是**常量**，所以 `world` 面板里的 B 坐标架钉在 3 m 处自转，而板圈在 2.8–3.2 m 之间晃，两者**脱开**。`TargetMotion` 的返回字典里没有 `positions`（只有 `body_rotations`），所以修法是用对称环的中心反推：\n\n```python\nbody_pos = centers.mean(1)      # 环对称 => local_pos 均值为 0\n```\n\n然后把第 182–183、154 行的 `BODY_POS` 换成 `body_pos[index]`。\n\n---\n\n以上只是诊断。要真正改文件（去掉/积分 `yaw_rate`、让 B 坐标架跟随 `centers.mean(1)`、以及之前已经达成共识的有界 `sinus` 参数、文本坐标闸门、`project` 退化保护等）需要切到 **work 模式**——chat 模式下 `run_command` 只放行只读命令，我无法写盘也无法运行脚本。"}
